This product includes protobuf definitions from the NS Messaging API 2.6.0
(proto/ns-messaging, Apache License, Version 2.0, see proto/ns-messaging/LICENSE)
and Swift code generated from them
(Packages/Destinations/Sources/Destinations/GRPC/Generated).

This product includes the Bluetooth SIG Assigned Numbers lists
company_identifiers.yaml, member_uuids.yaml and service_uuids.yaml, from
https://bitbucket.org/bluetooth-SIG/public (assigned_numbers/). The company
and member lists are the same files the Network Survey Android app ships
(NetworkSurvey/Screens/Details/Resources, refreshed with
scripts/update-bluetooth-numbers.sh).

The app also includes third-party Swift packages under their own licenses
(Apache License 2.0 and MIT). Their full license and notice texts are bundled
in NetworkSurvey/Screens/Settings/Resources/third-party-licenses.json
(generated by scripts/gen-licenses.sh) and shown in the app under
Settings > Open-source licenses.
